  "description": "The PDQ 3 combines two worlds thanks to its advanced geometry concept – the result is a bike that is efficient, fast, suitable for climbing and also great fun on downhills. 120 mm travel together with the long reach provide the PDQ with superior handling and give you a feeling of safety on every trail. The lightweight carbon frame offers the perfect balance of stiffness and flexibility to feel uncompromisingly fast. The Newmen Advanced carbon seatpost, Newmen Advanced SL X carbon wheels, ROSE One-Piece carbon XC cockpit and carbon crankset make the PDQ 3 the lightest of its kind, giving you thus the competitive advantage you want on the mountain. ¹ approx. 8.9 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for Oat Milk frame, size M, without pedals",
